[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9661.27, "timestamp": "02:41:01", "text": "啊，它崩溃了。 不。搞什么鬼？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9671.75, "timestamp": "02:41:11", "text": "，我还需要早睡。 明天晚上是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9695.67, "timestamp": "02:41:35", "text": "等等，我刚才辛辛苦苦做的一切是不是都丢了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9699.11, "timestamp": "02:41:39", "text": "？ 呃，不。 感谢上帝。 好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9701.51, "timestamp": "02:41:41", "text": "等等，等等，等等，等等，等等。 呃，想想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9703.51, "timestamp": "02:41:43", "text": "想想。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9717.67, "timestamp": "02:41:57", "text": "[音乐]"}]